1
00:00:00,359 --> 00:00:03,573
This isn't Earth.

2
00:00:03,573 --> 00:00:06,822
Yeah? Then who the hell
are you talking to me?

3
00:00:07,213 --> 00:00:11,832
I'm Tawan, Earth's friend.
Are you Gun?

4
00:00:11,832 --> 00:00:13,812
Yeah.

5
00:00:14,114 --> 00:00:15,911
Go get Earth.
Tell him to talk to me.

6
00:00:17,173 --> 00:00:21,593
Sorry, bro. I don't think he can.
He's sick and asleep right now.

7
00:00:21,593 --> 00:00:27,224
He won't make sense if he talks now.
You can call again later.

8
00:00:27,224 --> 00:00:29,013
Where's Earth?

9
00:00:29,013 --> 00:00:30,818
In my room.

10
00:00:30,818 --> 00:00:35,040
Okay. Send me your location.
I'll come get him.

11
00:00:45,719 --> 00:00:50,000
Uh… hello?

12
00:00:55,280 --> 00:01:00,960
I sent it already. It's not far.
You can pick Earth up easily.

13
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,458
Okay.

14
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:08,366
Hey, you're back already?

15
00:01:08,366 --> 00:01:09,487
You're awake?

16
00:01:11,922 --> 00:01:14,128
My phone—who were you talking to?

17
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:15,687
Gun.

18
00:01:15,776 --> 00:01:16,422
Huh?

19
00:01:17,506 --> 00:01:21,883
Why are you so shocked? Are you crazy?

20
00:01:23,429 --> 00:01:24,465
What did you say to Gun?

21
00:01:24,625 --> 00:01:27,409
He said he's coming to see you here.

22
00:01:29,489 --> 00:01:30,504
Shit…

23
00:01:30,504 --> 00:01:33,598
Hey, what's wrong with you?
Why so panicked?

24
00:01:34,931 --> 00:01:36,076
Ow—

25
00:01:36,876 --> 00:01:38,347
What's wrong with you now?

26
00:01:39,129 --> 00:01:40,993
Are you trying to make my fever worse?

27
00:01:41,171 --> 00:01:42,152
What did I do?

28
00:01:43,343 --> 00:01:45,213
He's probably almost here.

29
00:01:45,391 --> 00:01:45,902
Huh?

30
00:01:52,049 --> 00:01:53,283
What's wrong with you, seriously?

31
00:01:55,114 --> 00:01:58,381
Hey—uh, I'll go now.

32
00:01:58,523 --> 00:02:01,818
What? You're not sleeping here?

33
00:02:03,258 --> 00:02:06,079
Hey—Earth! Earth!

34
00:02:07,928 --> 00:02:10,960
What the hell is going on?
